    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>Here are the Cost Management features that are in preview as of October 2019.</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n\t<thead>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\"><strong>Feature area &nbsp;</strong></th>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\"><strong>Feature</strong></th>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</thead>\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Forecasting</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cost-management/quick-acm-cost-analysis#review-costs-in-cost-analysis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Forecast Azure costs</a></td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Forecast Azure + AWS costs</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Cross cloud</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cost-management/aws-integration-set-up-configure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Import AWS cost data into ACM</a></td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cost-management/aws-integration-manage#set-budgets-on-aws-scopes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Alert on AWS costs in budgets</a></td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cost-management/aws-integration-manage#view-aws-costs-in-cost-analysis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Analyze AWS data in Cost Analysis</a></td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>**Please note that feature availability may vary by offer type. For more details, see the <a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cost-management/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cost Management documentation</a><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cost-management/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">.</a></p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Here are the Cost Management features that are in preview as of October 2019.\n\nFeature area\n\nFeature\n\nForecasting\n\nForecast Azure costs\n\nForecast Azure + AWS costs\n\nCross cloud\n\nImport AWS cost data into ACM\n\nAlert on AWS costs in budgets\n\nAnalyze AWS data in Cost Analysis\n\n**Please note that feature availability may vary by offer type. For more details, see the Cost Management documentation ."
  },
